hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1928","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo ghaaeb they, phir tashreef laaey aur unkey saamney gosht rakha gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye hamaari qurbaniyon key gosht mein se hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Use peechey karo, main use na chakhoonga. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir main utha aur nikla yahan tak ke apne bhai Abu Qataada key paas aaya, aur wo uski maan ka bhai tha jabke wo Badri tha. To main ne us se uska zikr kya. To us ne kaha: Beshak tumhaarey baad muamla naya hua hai. (Bukhari: 5568)"
"1929","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo qurbani karey wo teesri key baad subah na karey jabke uskey ghar mein us mein se kuchh baaqi ho. Phir jab agla saal tha to unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham waisa karein jaisa ham ne pichhley saal kya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Khaao aur khilaao aur jama karo! Beshak us saal logon mein mehnat thi, to main ne chaaha ke tum us mein madad karo. (Bukhari: 5569)"
